over there? Be right there.

c105
00:07:09.779 --> 00:07:10.780
Sit there.

c106
00:07:12.029 --> 00:07:13.030
Fine thing.

c107
00:07:14.404 --> 00:07:17.905
As soon as Kay isn't around to
supervise, you go off on a vacation. You

c108
00:07:17.989 --> 00:07:23.470
know, Maestro, I don't think your
date ideas are so original. What?

c109
00:07:24.109 --> 00:07:26.170
About what to do on a date, I mean.

c110
00:07:27.350 --> 00:07:33.609
But what I'd like to know is, how can you
figure out what a girl would like to do?

c111
00:07:34.399 --> 00:07:35.859
A certain girl, I mean.

c112
00:07:36.799 --> 00:07:38.480
Well, you might ask her.
